OL,3,ATrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint
OL,4,Adeclaration on peace' after 90-minute
OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,8,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,9,Fwar
OL,11,FMeanwhile, Ukraine and its allies in
OL,12,Fthe "Coalition of the Willing" -
OL,13,Fincluding UK PM Andy Burnham - are
OL,14,Fmeeting in Berlin
